#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:184
#: 9c5e9e3f60f0433a93b2e76544f22777
msgid ""
"The behavior of returning to a mission sequence when interrupted by a mode "
"change is described in the :ref:`common-mission-rewind` section."
msgstr "模式切换中断任务后返回任务序列的行为，在 :ref:`common-mission-rewind` 部分中有详细说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:187
#: 9b566b29dac44ca6a97efd69a2731077
msgid "Mission Size"
msgstr "任务容量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events.rst:189
#: c9ce2c62e12847bb80d68b58b191a490
msgid ""
"The number of mission items which can be stored in the autopilot is limited "
"to approximately 650 waypoints. If you need to have longer missions, then "
"you can set the :ref:`BRD_SD_MISSION<BRD_SD_MISSION>` parameter to create a "
"file on the SD Card to store more. This can be set up to a maximum of 64 "
"(kB) which would allow a total of over 4,000 waypoints in a mission."
